Output docs/previews/tui-logs.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 12
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 8
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/target/release:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Type "droidkraft-tui --graphics halfblocks"
Enter
Show
Sleep 9s
Type "1"
Sleep 1s
Type "l"
Sleep 4s
Type "q"
